{
 "file": "17DRL01A base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:4d",
   "ptr": "0x4d",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「薬師のパルマンさんなら、\\n",
   "en": "\"If it's Palman-san the apothecary you want, he lives in the lone house up ahead.\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:6c",
   "ptr": "0x6c",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　この先の一軒家に住んでいるよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:4d"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:97",
   "ptr": "0x97",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "「クゥ～ン、クゥゥ～ン」\\f",
   "en": "\"Whine... Whiiine...\"",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:ba",
   "ptr": "0xba",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「ここに来る途中で、湖の中央に浮かぶ\\n",
   "en": "\"On your way here, did you see the ruins floating in the middle of the lake? They say there's no entrance, so no one can get inside...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:e3",
   "ptr": "0xe3",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　遺跡を見ませんでしたか？\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:ba"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:102",
   "ptr": "0x102",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　なんでも、あそこは入り口が無くて、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　遺跡を見ませんでしたか？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:ba"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:12b",
   "ptr": "0x12b",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　中に入れないとか・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:ba"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:149",
   "ptr": "0x149",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　以前、学者たちがこの村に来て、小舟\\n",
   "en": "Some scholars came to this village once and rowed across in a borrowed boat, but they never found the way in and came back empty-handed.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:172",
   "ptr": "0x172",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　を借りて渡っていきましたが、結局、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:149"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:19b",
   "ptr": "0x19b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　入り口が解らず、手ぶらで戻って来ま\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:149"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:1c4",
   "ptr": "0x1c4",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　したよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:149"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:1e1",
   "ptr": "0x1e1",
   "len": 6,
   "jp": "村長\\n",
   "en": "Village Chief",
   "max": 6,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:1ea",
   "ptr": "0x1ea",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "「見なされ・・・\\n",
   "en": "\"Look... They say the ancients dammed a river long ago to make this vast lake.",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "村長\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:1ff",
   "ptr": "0x1ff",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　この広大な湖は、その昔、古代人が川\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:1ea"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:228",
   "ptr": "0x228",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　をせき止めて造った人造湖だそうじゃ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:1ea"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:254",
   "ptr": "0x254",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　村の西に古い水門があったじゃろ？\\n",
   "en": "You saw the old floodgate west of the village, eh? That gate hasn't opened even once since ages past.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:27b",
   "ptr": "0x27b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あの水門は、はるか昔から１度も開い\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:254"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:2a4",
   "ptr": "0x2a4",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "　たことがない。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:254"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:2ba",
   "ptr": "0x2ba",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　しかも、水門を開閉する仕掛けがどこ\\n",
   "en": "What's more, nobody knows where the mechanism that works it is. The scholars from the capital were all scratching their heads, I tell you.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:2e3",
   "ptr": "0x2e3",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　にあるかもわからないのじゃ。都から\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:2ba"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:30c",
   "ptr": "0x30c",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　来た学者たちも、皆、首をひねってお\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:2ba"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:335",
   "ptr": "0x335",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　ったよ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:2ba"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:345",
   "ptr": "0x345",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　まったく、昔の人の知恵は偉大じゃの\\n",
   "en": "My, the wisdom of the ancients is a marvel, eh...\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:36e",
   "ptr": "0x36e",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　う・・・」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 17DRL01A:345"
  },
  {
   "id": "17DRL01A:382",
   "ptr": "0x382",
   "len": 6,
